Vendored test fixture
=====================

`test-repo-v1/` is a verbatim copy of

    icechunk-python/tests/data/test-repo-v1

from the earth-mover/icechunk repository at tag v2.0.0
(https://github.com/earth-mover/icechunk), where it is the project's own
checked-in Icechunk spec-version-1 repository used by the migration tests in
`icechunk/src/migrations/mod.rs`.

    upstream   https://github.com/earth-mover/icechunk
    tag        v2.0.0
    path       icechunk-python/tests/data/test-repo-v1
    licence    Apache-2.0 (see ../../../workdir/icechunk-spec/LICENSE for the
               full text as shipped with this task)
    files      26 regular files: config.yaml, refs/, snapshots/, manifests/,
               transactions/, chunks/

Every file is checksummed in `tests/assets/SHA256SUMS`, which `/tests/test.sh`
verifies before any group runs; a corrupt fixture fails every group rather than
handing out free points.

The fixture is read-only at grading time: each case copies it into its own
temporary directory before migrating it.
